This directory is intended for more complex tests that cannot be effectively unit tested
Follow instructions in main.cpp for running these tests

Available test headers:
- `foc_motor_standalone_test.hpp`
- `foc_motor_test.hpp`
- `open_loop_vibe_motor_test.hpp` (uses `OpenLoopVibeMotor` with the same sinusoidal velocity command pattern as `foc_motor_standalone_test.hpp`)

Available test:
- `http_mp3_stream_test.hpp` - Connects to Wi-Fi and streams MP3 audio from an HTTP URL via I2S output.
	- Configure `WIFI_SSID`, `WIFI_PASSWORD`, and `MP3_HTTP_URL` in the header before running.
	- Uses library: `https://github.com/schreibfaul1/ESP32-audioI2S.git`.